        ],
        "structural_description": "Level 50 PassiveYour Ripple channel performs a unique effect based on your active Aeon:Rippling RenewalRipple periodically heals allies within 0 yds for 71 + 12.5% SP every 1 sec.Rippling OblivionRipple deals periodic damage to enemies within 25 yds for 156 + 38.5% SP every 1 sec.Rippling ProtectionRipple now places a damage absorb for 420 + 75% healing on allies within 15 yds for the duration of its channel.Rippling ResilienceRipple now delays 30% of incoming direct Physical Damage to allies within 15 yds for it's duration, instead taking it over 5 seconds."
      }
